  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></munderover><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Using <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> when<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, finding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></munderover><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></munderover><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced>